# Iris — Docker Ignore Policy
# Purpose: Build a slim production image by ignoring dev/test dependencies and agentic noise.

# --- Node / Frontend / Next / Storybook ---
node_modules
.next
storybook-static
out
build
dist
**/*.stories.tsx

# --- Tests ---
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
tests
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx

# --- Environment & Secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- IDEs & OS ---
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# --- Version Control ---
.git
.github
.husky

# --- Agentic Noise & Tooling ---
.claude
.superpowers
.tokensave
.headroom
.playwright-mcp
graphify-out
skills-lock.json
.vercel

# --- Database & Documentation ---
db/tests
db/backups
docs
*.md
!README.md
